# Jazal Goldmane: "Attacking creatures you control get +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of attacking creatures." On
# turn 4 Bot2's Ornithopter attacks and Bot1 activates Jazal (which is not attacking): no creature Bot1 controls is
# attacking, so none is pumped, and the opponent's attacker is not one "you control", so it stays a 0/2 and Jazal a 4/4 (CR 611.2c).

